#. ja: 討伐手帳『<sheet MonsterNote $n1 9>』<sheet BNpcName $n2 0>の討伐 <num $n3>/<num $n4>
#. de: Sieg über <noun-de BNpcName 1 $n2 1 4 1> (<num $n3>/<num $n4>) zu Bestiariumseintrag „<sheet MonsterNote $n1 9>“ hinzugefügt.
#. fr: Vous notez l'élimination d'<noun-fr BNpcName 1 $n2 1 1> dans la rubrique <sheet MonsterNote $n1 9> de votre bestiaire (<num $n3>/<num $n4>).
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 3 $n2 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 3, row = number parameter 2, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n4> — a number; value = number parameter 4 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <sheet MonsterNote $n1 9> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MonsterNote, row = number parameter 1, column = 9 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1001:0:5"
msgid "Record of <noun-en BNpcName 3 $n2 1 1> kill (<num $n3>/<num $n4>) added to hunting log entry <sheet MonsterNote $n1 9>."
msgstr "Запись об убийстве <noun-en BNpcName 3 $n2 1 1> добавлена в раздел «<sheet MonsterNote $n1 9>» журнала охоты (<num $n3>/<num $n4>)."

#. ja: 討伐手帳に「<sheet BNpcName $n2 0>」の討伐完了を記録した。
#. de: Genügend <noun-de BNpcName 5 $n2 2 4 1> für dein Bestiarium besiegt!
#. fr: Vous avez vaincu le nombre demandé <noun-fr BNpcName 8 $n2 2 1> pour l'entrée du bestiaire.
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 3 $n2 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 3, row = number parameter 2, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1002:0:5"
msgid "Hunting log entry for <noun-en BNpcName 3 $n2 2 1> complete!"
msgstr "Запись о <noun-en BNpcName 3 $n2 2 1> в журнале охоты завершена!"

#. ja: 討伐手帳『<sheet MonsterNote $n1 9>』をコンプリートした！
#. de: Der Bestiariumseintrag „<sheet MonsterNote $n1 9>“ ist vollständig!
#. fr: La rubrique <sheet MonsterNote $n1 9> de votre bestiaire est achevée<nbsp>!
#. macro: <sheet MonsterNote $n1 9> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MonsterNote, row = number parameter 1, column = 9 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1003:0:5"
msgid "Hunting log entry <sheet MonsterNote $n1 9> complete!"
msgstr "Запись «<sheet MonsterNote $n1 9>» в журнале охоты завершена!"

#. ja: 討伐手帳『<sheet ClassJob $n1 0>ランク<num $n2>』をコンプリートした！
#. de: Alle Bestiariumseinträge für Rang <num $n2> der Klasse <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> vollständig!
#. fr: Le rang <num $n2> du chapitre <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> de votre bestiaire est complet<nbsp>!
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ClassJob, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1004:0:5"
msgid "All rank <num $n2> hunting log entries for <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> complete!"
msgstr "Все записи ранга <num $n2> для класса «<sheet ClassJob $n1 0>» в журнале охоты завершены!"

#. ja: 討伐手帳『<sheet GrandCompany $n1 0>ランク<num $n2>』をコンプリートした！
#. de: Alle Einträge für Rang <num $n2> deines <noun-de GrandCompany 5 $n1 1 1 1>-Bestiariums vollständig!
#. fr: Le rang <num $n2> du chapitre sur <sheet GrandCompany $n1 8 1> de votre bestiaire est complet<nbsp>!
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <sheet GrandCompany $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GrandCompany, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
