msgctxt "LogMessage:1110:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>cast your<else>casts <if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">her<else>his</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>his</if></if></if> line <if \"<sheet PlaceName $n1 1>\"><switch \"<sheet PlaceName $n1 1>\"><case>in <case>on </switch><else>at </if><noun-en PlaceName 2 $n1 2 1>."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>забрасываете свою<else>забрасывает <if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">свою<else>свою</if><else><if $gn5>свою<else>свою</if></if></if> удочку <if \"<sheet PlaceName $n1 1>\"><switch \"<sheet PlaceName $n1 1>\"><case>в <case>на </switch><else>у </if><noun-en PlaceName 2 $n1 2 1>."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は釣りを終えた。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>hast<else>hat</if> das Fischen beendet.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>arrêtez<else>arrête</if> de pêcher.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>put away your<else>puts away <if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">her<else>his</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>his</if></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">her<else>his</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>his</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = text with macros (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet BNpcName $gn7 6> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = BNpcName, row = global number 7, column = 6 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $gn5>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 5 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1111:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>put away your<else>puts away <if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">her<else>his</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>his</if></if></if> rod."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>вы<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>убираете свою удочку<else>убирает <if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">свою<else>свою</if><else><if $gn5>свою<else>свою</if></if> удочку</if>."

#. ja: 戦闘不能になったため、釣りが中断されました。
#. de: Das Fischen wurde abgebrochen, weil <if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> kampfunfähig <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>bist<else>ist</if>.
#. fr: Pêche interrompue. <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>êtes<else>est</if> inconscient<if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">e</if><else><if $gn5>e</if></if>.
msgctxt "LogMessage:1112:0:5"
msgid "Fishing canceled. You were defeated."
msgstr "Рыбалка прервана. Тебя одолели."

#. ja: 敵から攻撃を受けたため、釣りが中断されました。
#. de: Das Fischen wurde abgebrochen, weil <if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> angegriffen <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>wirst<else>wird</if>.
#. fr: Pêche interrompue. <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>êtes<else>est</if> attaqué<if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">e</if><else><if $gn5>e</if></if>.
msgctxt "LogMessage:1113:0:5"
msgid "Fishing canceled. You have entered battle."
msgstr "Рыбалка прервана. Начался бой."

#. ja: 魚類図鑑に<sheet Item $n1 0>の情報を記録した！
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 1 1></capitalize> wurde <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>in deinem Fischverzeichnis<else>im Fischverzeichnis von <if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></if> vermerkt.
#. fr: Vous notez les in<shy>for<shy>ma<shy>tions <noun-fr Item 9 $n1 1 1> dans votre nomenclature.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1114:0:5"
msgid "Data on <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> is added to your fish guide."
msgstr "Сведения о <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> добавлены в рыболовный справочник."

#. ja: 釣り手帳に新しい釣り場「<sheet PlaceName $n1 0>」の情報を記録した！
#. de: Die neue Angelstelle „<sheet PlaceName $n1 0>“ wurde in deinem Fischer-Notizbuch vermerkt.
#. fr: Vous notez l'emplacement du point de pêche “<sheet PlaceName $n1 0>” dans votre carnet.
#. macro: <noun-en PlaceName 2 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = PlaceName, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1115:0:5"
msgid "Data on <noun-en PlaceName 2 $n1 2 1> is added to your fishing log."
msgstr "Сведения о <noun-en PlaceName 2 $n1 2 1> добавлены в рыболовный журнал."

#. ja: 魚をフッキングした！
#. de: Etwas hat angebissen!
#. fr: Vous avez une touche<nbsp>!
msgctxt "LogMessage:1116:0:5"
msgid "Something bites!"
msgstr "Клюёт!"

#. ja: いつの間にか釣り餌をとられてしまった……。
#. de: Der Fisch hat den Köder vom Haken gefressen ...
#. fr: L'appât a disparu...
msgctxt "LogMessage:1117:0:5"
msgid "You lose your bait..."
msgstr "Ты упускаешь наживку..."

#. ja: いつの間にか<sheet Item $n1 0>をロストしてしまった！
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 1 1></capitalize> ist davongeschwommen.
#. fr: Vous avez perdu votre <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 1 1>...
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1118:0:5"
msgid "You lose your <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1>..."
msgstr "Ты теряешь <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1>..."

#. ja: 釣り針にかかった魚に逃げられてしまった……。
#. de: Der Fisch konnte sich vom Haken reißen.
#. fr: Le poisson a réussi à se défaire de l'hameçon...
msgctxt "LogMessage:1119:0:5"
msgid "The fish gets away..."
msgstr "Рыба сорвалась..."

#. ja: ラインブレイク！！
#. de: Die Leine ist gerissen!
#. fr: Le fil s'est cassé<nbsp>!
msgctxt "LogMessage:1120:0:5"
msgid "Your line breaks!"
msgstr "Леска оборвалась!"

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は釣り上げた<sheet Item $n1 0>を慎重に投げ込み、泳がせ釣りを試みた。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>hast<else>hat</if> die Leine mit <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 3 1> als Köder ausgeworfen.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>essayez<else>essaie</if> de pêcher au vif avec <noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>que vous avez<else>qu'<if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> a</if> attrapé<if "<sheet Item $n1 6>">e</if>.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>recast your<else>recasts <if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">her<else>his</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>his</if></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">her<else>his</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>his</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = text with macros (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet BNpcName $gn7 6> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = BNpcName, row = global number 7, column = 6 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $gn5>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 5 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1121:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>recast your<else>recasts <if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">her<else>his</if><else><if $gn5>her<else>his</if></if></if> line with the fish still hooked."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>ты<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>снова забрасываешь свою удочку<else>снова забрасывает <if $gn7><if \"<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>\">свою<else>свою</if><else><if $gn5>свою<else>свою</if></if> удочку</if>, не снимая рыбу с крючка."

#. ja: 採集手帳に漁師の頁が追加されました
#. de: Deinem Sammler-Notizbuch wurde eine Fischer-Seite hinzugefügt.
#. fr: Une page sur la pêche a été ajoutée à votre carnet de récolte.
msgctxt "LogMessage:1122:0:5"
msgid "A page on fishing has been added to your gathering log."
msgstr "В журнале собирателя появилась страница о рыбалке."

#. ja: 釣り餌を選んでいないので、釣りができません。
#. de: Du musst einen Köder auswählen, um zu fischen.
#. fr: Impossible de pêcher. Vous n'avez pas choisi d'appât.
msgctxt "LogMessage:1123:0:5"
msgid "Unable to fish. No bait has been specified."
msgstr "Невозможно рыбачить: не выбрана наживка."

#. ja: ここで釣りを開始するためには、以下の特性が必要です。<br><sheet Trait $n1 0>
#. de: Hier scheint es Fische zu geben, aber du benötigst die Eigenschaft <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><sheet Trait $n1 0></ui-edge-color></ui-color>, um sie zu fangen.
#. fr: Vous devez posséder le trait “<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501><sheet Trait $n1 0></ui-edge-color></ui-color>” pour pouvoir pêcher ici.
#. macro: <sheet Trait $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Trait, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1124:0:5"
msgid "You can sense something swimming below, but must first learn <sheet Trait $n1 0> before you can try catching it."
msgstr "Ты чувствуешь, что под водой что-то движется, но сначала нужно освоить умение «<sheet Trait $n1 0>»."

#. ja: 魚の気配は感じるが、どこに潜んでいるか見当もつかない……。
#. de: Hier scheint es Fische zu geben, aber du kannst nicht erkennen, wo sie sich verstecken.
#. fr: Vous sentez qu'il y a des poissons ici, mais vous n'arrivez pas à voir où ils se cachent...
msgctxt "LogMessage:1125:0:5"
msgid "You can sense something swimming below, but are uncertain where."
msgstr "Ты чувствуешь, что под водой что-то есть, но не знаешь, где оно прячется..."

#. ja: ここには魚がいないようだ……。
#. de: Hier scheint es keine Fische zu geben.
#. fr: Ce point de pêche n'a pas l'air très poissonneux...
msgctxt "LogMessage:1126:0:5"
msgid "You do not sense any fish here."
msgstr "Похоже, здесь рыбы нет."

#. ja: 何もかからなかった……。<br>釣り餌が釣り場にあってないようだ。
#. de: Nichts beißt an. Vielleicht ist es nicht der richtige Köder?
#. fr: Vous n'avez pas eu de touche... Essayez avec un autre appât.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1127:0:5"
msgid "Nothing bites. <br>The bait you are using may not be suited to this location."
msgstr "Не клюёт.<br>Похоже, эта наживка не подходит для этого места."

#. ja: このアクションは現在実行できません。
#. de: Dieses Kommando kannst du momentan nicht ausführen.
#. fr: Impossible d'exécuter cette action maintenant.
msgctxt "LogMessage:1128:0:5"
msgid "Unable to use that action at this time."
msgstr "Сейчас это действие недоступно."

#. ja: 何もかからなかった……。
#. de: Du hast nichts gefangen.
#. fr: Vous n'avez pas réussi à ferrer le poisson...
msgctxt "LogMessage:1129:0:5"
msgid "Nothing bites."
msgstr "Не клюёт."

#. ja: 新しい釣り場「<sheet PlaceName $n1 0>」を発見した！
#. de: Du hast eine neue Angelstelle entdeckt: <sheet PlaceName $n1 0>!
#. fr: Vous avez découvert le point de pêche “<sheet PlaceName $n1 0>”.
#. macro: <noun-en PlaceName 2 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = PlaceName, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1130:0:5"
msgid "You have discovered the fishing location, <noun-en PlaceName 2 $n1 2 1>."
msgstr "Ты обнаружил место для рыбалки: <noun-en PlaceName 2 $n1 2 1>."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>はステータス異常のため、製作を行えません。
#. de: Unter dem derzeitigen Status kannst du keine Synthese durchführen.
#. fr: Une altération d'état <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous empêche<else>empêche <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></if> de faire une synthèse.
msgctxt "LogMessage:1131:0:5"
msgid "A status affliction prevents you from crafting."
msgstr "Эффект состояния не позволяет заниматься ремеслом."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は敵から攻撃を受けたため、製作が中断されました。
#. de: Synthese wurde unterbrochen, da du angegriffen wurdest.
#. fr: Synthèse interrompue. <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>êtes<else>est</if> attaqué<if $gn7><if "<sheet BNpcName $gn7 6>">e</if><else><if $gn5>e</if></if>.
msgctxt "LogMessage:1133:0:5"
msgid "Crafting canceled. You have entered battle."
msgstr "Ремесло прервано. Начался бой."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は所持品に空き枠がないため、製作を行えません。
#. de: Synthese nicht möglich, da kein Platz im Inventar ist.
#. fr: Synthèse impossible. Vous n'avez pas assez de place dans votre inventaire.
msgctxt "LogMessage:1134:0:5"
msgid "Unable to craft. Insufficient inventory space."
msgstr "Невозможно заниматься ремеслом: в инвентаре не хватает места."

