#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は<sheet Item $n3 0>のマテリア精製をした！<br>  <sheet Item $n1 0>を手に入れた。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>hast aus <noun-de Item 2 $n3 1 3 1><else>hat aus <noun-de Item 1 $n3 1 3 1></if> Materia extrahiert und <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1> erhalten.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>matérialisez<else>matérialise</if> <noun-fr Item 1 $n3 1 1> et <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>obtenez<else>obtient</if> <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1>.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>extract<else>extracts</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n3 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 3, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1200:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> successfully <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>extract<else>extracts</if> <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> from <noun-en Item 2 $n3 1 1>."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Ты<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> успешно извлекаешь <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> из <noun-en Item 2 $n3 1 1>."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は<sheet Item $n1 0>に<sheet Item $n2 0>を装着した！<if ($n3 > 0)><br>  その過程で<sheet Item $n2 0><num $n3>個が粉々に砕け散った……</if>
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>hast <noun-de Item 2 $n2 1 4 1> in <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1><else>hat <noun-de Item 1 $n2 1 4 1> in <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1></if> eingesetzt!<if ($n3 > 0)> Dabei wurde<if ($n3 == 1)><else>n</if> <num $n3> Materia verbraucht.</if>
