#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>attach<else>attaches</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
