#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n3 > 0)> <num $n3> materia <if ($n3 > 1)>were<else>was</if> lost in the process.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
