#. fr: Le sertissage <noun-fr Item 9 $n1 1 1> a échoué... <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>avez perdu<else>a perdu</if> <num $n3> <noun-fr Item 12 $n2 $n3 1>.
