msgctxt "LogMessage:1202:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>are<else>is</if> unable to attach <noun-en Item 1 $n2 1 1> to <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>. <num $n3> materia <if ($n3 > 1)>were<else>was</if> lost in the process."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Ты<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>не можешь<else>не может</if> вставить <noun-en Item 1 $n2 1 1> в <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>. Потеряно <num $n3> материи."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>を持っていません。
#. de: Du hast <noun-de Item 4 $n1 1 4 1>.
#. fr: Vous n'avez pas <noun-fr Item 8 $n1 1 1>.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1203:0:5"
msgid "To attach that materia, you require <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>."
msgstr "Чтобы вставить эту материю, тебе потребуется <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>×<num $n2>を復元した！<br>  <sheet Item $n3 0>×<num $n2>を手に入れた。
#. de: Du hast <noun-de Item 1 $n1 $n2 4 1> wieder<shy>her<shy>gestellt und erhältst <noun-de Item 1 $n3 $n2 4 1>.
#. fr: Vous avez reconstitué <num $n2> <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 $n2 1><nbsp>! Vous obtenez <num $n2> <noun-fr Item 12 $n3 $n2 1>.
#. macro: <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 1 $n1 $n2 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
