#. macro: <if ($n2 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n3 1 1><else><num $n2> <noun-en Item 1 $n3 $n2 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
