msgctxt "LogMessage:1361:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if><else><num $n1></if></capitalize> <if ($n1 == 1)>minute<else>minutes</if> remaining."
msgstr "<capitalize><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>одна<case>две<case>три<case>четыре<case>пять<case>шесть<case>семь<case>восемь<case>девять<case>десять</switch><else><num $n1></if><else><num $n1></if></capitalize> <if ($n1 == 1)>минута<else>минут</if> осталось."

#. ja: 任地「<if ($n3 > 0)><sheet PlaceName $n1 0><else>？？？？</if>」の『<sheet Leve $n2 0>』を受け取った。
#. de: „<sheet Leve $n2 0>“ für das Areal <if ($n3 > 0)><sheet PlaceName $n1 8 2><else>???</if> angenommen.
#. fr: Vous avez accepté le mandat “<sheet Leve $n2 0>”.<br>Lieu de mission<nbsp>: <if ($n3 > 0)><sheet PlaceName $n1 8 1><else>???</if>.
#. macro: <sheet Leve $n2 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Leve, row = number parameter 2, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
