#. macro: <sheet PlaceName "<sheet Aetheryte $n1 9>" 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = PlaceName, row = text with macros, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <sheet Aetheryte $n1 9> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Aetheryte, row = number parameter 1, column = 9 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
