msgstr "Вы получили <num $n2> <noun-en EventItem 3 $n1 $n2 1>. (<num $n3>/<num $n4>)"

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName $n1 0><if ($n2 == 1)><else><if ($n3 == 0)><else>等</if><num $n2>体</if>が出現！
#. de: <num $n2> <if ($n2 == 1)>Gegner erscheint<else>Gegner erscheinen</if>!
#. fr: <num $n2> <if ($n2 <= 1)>ennemi surgit<else>ennemis surgissent</if><nbsp>!
