#. macro: <sheet InstanceContent $n1 3> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = InstanceContent, row = number parameter 1, column = 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1522:0:5"
msgid "“<capitalize><sheet InstanceContent $n1 3></capitalize>” failed or abandoned."
msgstr "Задание «<capitalize><sheet InstanceContent $n1 3></capitalize>» провалено или оставлено."

