#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>hast<else>hat</if> <noun-de Item 1 $n2 1 4 1> erhalten.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>obtenez<else>obtient</if> <noun-fr Item 1 $n2 1 1>.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
