#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1951:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> contains gear unequippable by your current class/job."
msgstr "<capitalize><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> содержит снаряжение, которое нельзя надеть выбранным классом или заданием."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>は、都市やフィールドで使用可能です。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 1 1></capitalize> kann nur in Städten<br>und außerhalb von instanziierten Arealen benutzt werden.
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> peut être utilisé<if "<sheet Item $n1 6>">e</if> dans les cités et les zones en dehors.
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1952:0:5"
