msgid "You attempt to remove the materia from <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>."
msgstr "Вы пытаетесь снять материю с предмета «<noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>»."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>の回収に成功した！
#. de: Du hast <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1> zurückgewonnen!
#. fr: Vous récupérez <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 1 1><nbsp>!
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:1954:0:5"
msgid "You receive <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>."
msgstr "Вы получаете <noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1>."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>は粉々に砕け散った……。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 1 1></capitalize> zerfällt zu wertlosem Staub<nbsp>...
#. fr: <capitalize><noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1></capitalize> s'est désintégré<if "<sheet Item $n1 6>">e</if>...
